From: Claude Lane A <lane-a@local.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:13:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 08/22] test(tools): fixture v2 scorer and a layout-gate
 comparison runner

score_fixture.py runs the production streamer-reaction picker on
Sanji's streamer fixture v2 and checks his contract literally (R3 #1,
R1/R2 above the decoy, context kept, no cut burst). gate_compare.py
runs the plain path's real layout decision on 15 real clips under any
code tree, so two reaction gates can be compared on the same evidence.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
